    "detailed_description": "Detective Penguin is the first and only physics-and-penguin-based detective game on the market. Solve cases in your own way. Interrogate suspects, find clues, or use your flippers to punch your way to the answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>Take on the role of Detective Nooter, a student fresh out of detective school who has moved to Penguin Village in order to get some real life experience. As a new arrival in the village you'll be working for the Penguin Village Detective Bureau. Rex Fontaine, a disillusioned but highly experienced detective, has taken you under his wings and is ready to teach you all you need to know to become a great detective.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve Cases Your Own Way, With Violence or Wit<br></li><li>Explore Penguin Village<br></li><li>Discover and Play Multiple Mini-games<br></li><li>Dress Your Detective Penguin However You Want!<br></li><li>Talk to Dozens of Unique Characters<br></li><li>Uncover Multiple Side Cases<br></li><li>Solve the case of Missing Mackerel</li></ul><br><br>Penguin Village is a place full of interesting characters and mysteries to discover. Will you be able to solve the case of the Missing Mackerel? The world of Detective Penguin awaits you.",
